Text_en:
"Don't be afraid and blow, for the right of a woman; 
Let's open the door like Ahrman"
#woman_life_of_freedom

Let our black night dawn, let all the whips be axed; 
For #Mehdi_Yerahi who was whipped with his voice on the body of this black night. 
#woman_life_of_freedom

text:
